title: "Gravity Field Dynamics: research archive"
abstract: "A covariant theory of gravity whose interpolating function, mu(x) = x/(x + 1), is derived from the exchange symmetry of the tetrad's two parity-related roots. Includes the papers, formal proofs, documentation and validation code."
